# The compare (GitHub compare API), asserted whole (merge_base + ahead + files; NOT behind — see the header):
# develop...#1037 = 34cdcfb26 ahead 3 files 6 (behind 1: develop moved to f6669623c after the seat pushed; behind deliberately NOT asserted). Compare API 00:14:55Z 2026-09-18.
